message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "backcast: extend official statistics back across methodology breaks"
abstract: "R package that extends a new-method statistics series back across a methodology break with five published splicing methods side by side, reports how far they disagree, validates them where both series were published, and checks a spliced series for one level or trend break."
